# Rust guidance
{%- if use_tauri %}

Use the complete repository quality gate in `.codex/project.md`, including for Rust-only shell changes. It runs the Rust checks against `src-tauri/Cargo.toml`.
{%- else %}

Run the Rust quality checks from the repository root:

```bash
cargo fmt --all --check
cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings
cargo test --all-targets --all-features
```
{%- endif %}
